# The image gets only what the app runs on (KC-0157): everything is out unless named below,
# so a new file in the repo (a .env, a data folder, docs) never slips into an image.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!src/
!public/
!config/
# The scripted agent's mail fixtures (KC_AGENT=fake); the rest of test/ stays out.
!test/fixtures/
# KC-0245: the entrypoint that makes the key file for the encrypted model-key store.
!deploy/docker/start.sh
# Never, even inside an allowed folder:
**/.env*
**/node_modules
# The tenant image (KC-0157) never gets the control plane's code or secrets (KC-0176).
sky/
# The operator's cost ledger (KC-0212) is Henrik's, never a customer's: no owner card in a tenant.
config/omkostninger.json
